Generic single-database configuration for Freezer Management System.

This directory contains the Alembic database migration scripts for the project.

## Usage

To apply the latest migrations:
```
alembic upgrade head
```

To create a new migration:
```
alembic revision -m "description of changes"
```

To create a migration based on model changes:
```
alembic revision --autogenerate -m "description of changes"
```

To revert the most recent migration:
```
alembic downgrade -1
```

To get current migration info:
```
alembic current
```

To list all migrations:
```
alembic history
```